      "content": "$500 per person just for a reservation? That sounds a bit unusual even for Tokyo. Is that a standard thing for Ginza Sushi, or is this something special they're only doing because you're calling? I'm a little hesitant about the extra fees, but I really wanted that specific sushi. Is there any other way to get in, or is this the only option for tonight?",
